- Yes.

2541
01:53:49,860 --> 01:53:50,930
Was it you?

2542
01:53:52,860 --> 01:53:54,530
- I can't lie.
- Gosh.

2543
01:53:54,530 --> 01:53:56,760
They were all here.
I kept looking for them.

2544
01:53:57,060 --> 01:53:58,670
I kept studying them.

2545
01:53:59,200 --> 01:54:00,400
I see. They were here.

2546
01:54:00,770 --> 01:54:04,170
I went to Team P1's room
