2553
01:54:22,660 --> 01:54:24,860
That was when I thought, "This is it!"

2554
01:54:24,860 --> 01:54:29,400
I realized that these objects were placed
for us to solve.

2555
01:54:29,800 --> 01:54:32,330
I started pressing in the numbers...

2556
01:54:32,630 --> 01:54:35,440
