2585
01:55:54,480 --> 01:55:55,680
You Hyun, I guess?

2586
01:55:55,680 --> 01:55:56,850
You Hyun isn't that strong.

2587
01:55:56,850 --> 01:55:58,090
You Hyun or Sung Joo.

2588
01:55:58,290 --> 01:55:59,520
You never know,

2589
01:55:59,750 --> 01:56:01,320
Kwak Beom or Seung Yong might be...

2590
