2597
01:56:24,350 --> 01:56:25,980
The music video of "A Glass of Soju."

2598
01:56:26,050 --> 01:56:27,680
I know that one!

2599
01:56:27,850 --> 01:56:29,350
- I know that one!
- At the gas station!

2600
01:56:29,920 --> 01:56:30,990
Right.

2601
