- You should drink with us.

2615
01:57:05,020 --> 01:57:06,250
- Sit here.
- Thank you.

2616
01:57:06,450 --> 01:57:07,820
Move down a bit.

2617
01:57:08,420 --> 01:57:09,620
- Thank you.
- You all must've been...

2618
01:57:09,620 --> 01:57:10,790
