2619
01:57:10,790 --> 01:57:12,390
- Sorry?
- You've been drinking quite a bit.

2620
01:57:13,560 --> 01:57:14,900
- I drank so much.
- Really?

2621
01:57:14,960 --> 01:57:17,130
- How did you drink so much?
- I usually don't drink.

2622
01:57:17,370 --> 01:57:18,630
- You don't?
- I don't.

2623
01:57:19,270 --> 01:57:22,070
Come to our team, Ji Min.
We have a healer.

2624
01:57:22,800 --> 01:57:24,040
We have a healer.

2625
01:57:24,510 --> 01:57:26,170
He is a hilarious guy. I'm jealous.

2626
01:57:27,410 --> 01:57:29,410
I kept checking...

2627
01:57:29,640 --> 01:57:31,750
