2628
01:57:32,010 --> 01:57:34,680
Kwak Beom was completely drunk.

2629
01:57:35,050 --> 01:57:37,350
Nam Hee was also completely drunk.

2630
01:57:37,750 --> 01:57:40,190
You Hyun has drunk quite a lot as well.

2631
01:57:41,020 --> 01:57:43,020
Sung Joo has also drunk quite a lot.

2632
01:57:44,690 --> 01:57:45,930
You look sleepy.

2633
01:57:45,930 --> 01:57:48,830
If we are to be
in our best conditions tomorrow,

2634
01:57:49,130 --> 01:57:50,660
- We should go to bed.
- we should go to bed.

2635
01:57:51,630 --> 01:57:53,100
- Shall we go up?
- Shall we go to bed now?

2636
01:57:53,300 --> 01:57:54,400
Sounds good.

2637
01:57:54,400 --> 01:57:55,800
- We should go to bed now.
- Good night.

2638
