Nam Hee will go like this.

2653
01:58:50,520 --> 01:58:52,060
"What's going on?"

2654
01:58:52,060 --> 01:58:54,560
- "There must be a fire."
- Nam Hee is completely drunk.

2655
01:58:54,600 --> 01:58:56,560
It seems like
just the two of them are drunk.

2656
01:58:57,030 --> 01:58:59,830
(Kim Nam Hee)

2657
01:58:59,830 --> 01:59:03,670
(Hyun Sung Joo, Kwak Beom)

2658
01:59:03,670 --> 01:59:05,070
