2660
01:59:06,470 --> 01:59:07,580
This?

2661
01:59:08,640 --> 01:59:10,310
I just wanted to check this.

2662
01:59:10,310 --> 01:59:11,510
This might be...

2663
01:59:11,510 --> 01:59:12,550
What is that?

2664
01:59:12,550 --> 01:59:13,710
Well,

2665
01:59:13,910 --> 01:59:15,980
- it was an object that was upstairs.
- Right.

2666
01:59:16,280 --> 01:59:19,520
Something might be seen...

2667
01:59:19,790 --> 01:59:21,290
- with a special light.
- I see.

2668
01:59:21,290 --> 01:59:24,130
I thought that prism
might need to be checked.

2669
01:59:24,160 --> 01:59:25,960
"Could the objects around us..."

2670
01:59:25,960 --> 01:59:28,630
