- Right.

2676
02:00:00,030 --> 02:00:01,330
- Hello.
- Hello.

2677
02:00:06,330 --> 02:00:07,940
I thought that we got caught.

2678
02:00:07,940 --> 02:00:09,170
It was because...

2679
02:00:09,240 --> 02:00:10,910
I saw his eyes...

2680
02:00:11,010 --> 02:00:15,110
