2681
02:00:16,110 --> 02:00:19,710
I accidently ran into Team P1.

2682
02:00:19,750 --> 02:00:21,750
As they were all gathered together,
I went,

2683
02:00:22,950 --> 02:00:24,790
"Is that time trying to solve
the passcode of the safe?"

2684
02:00:24,790 --> 02:00:26,620
After that, I came out...

2685
02:00:27,390 --> 02:00:28,560
