2686
02:00:33,060 --> 02:00:34,400
Darn it.

2687
02:00:34,860 --> 02:00:36,060
Why did he come?

2688
02:00:38,770 --> 02:00:40,130
Darn it.

2689
02:00:41,570 --> 02:00:43,240
Must I take my panic disorder pills?

2690
02:00:43,240 --> 02:00:45,140
My heart is starting to pound.

2691
02:00:45,510 --> 02:00:47,940
I saw him for a short moment,
and the guy who came down...

2692
02:00:48,340 --> 02:00:50,140
- looked pretty fit.
- Right.

2693
02:00:50,580 --> 02:00:51,780
He's quite fit.

2694
02:00:51,780 --> 02:00:54,250
- He looked pretty strong.
- Right. An exercised body.

2695
02:00:54,950 --> 02:00:56,520
I felt so anxious as they weren't asleep.

2696
02:00:56,520 --> 02:00:57,850
They kept moving around
to look for things.

2697
02:00:57,850 --> 02:00:59,690
That was why I made a call.

2698
02:01:02,860 --> 02:01:04,890
- Hello?
- Hey, are you on your way?

2699
02:01:04,990 --> 02:01:07,360
Hey, Sang Min. We have arrived.

2700
02:01:07,360 --> 02:01:10,530
Right.
Two to three of them aren't sleeping yet.

2701
02:01:10,530 --> 02:01:12,100
- They're still awake?
- Right.

2702
02:01:12,370 --> 02:01:15,440
There are 2 to 3 of them moving around
in search of the passcode.

2703
02:01:15,440 --> 02:01:16,540
Oh, right.

2704
02:01:16,540 --> 02:01:19,040
Come in when you don't see any of them.

2705
02:01:19,040 --> 02:01:20,810
We're waiting in the main hall right now.

2706
02:01:20,810 --> 02:01:22,410
- The main hall?
- Right.

2707
02:01:22,510 --> 02:01:24,010
Okay. We'll sneak in.

2708
02:01:24,010 --> 02:01:25,280
- Okay.
- See you.

2709
02:01:26,880 --> 02:01:28,880
I hope they'll come before sunrise.

2710
02:01:29,980 --> 02:01:31,590
This is a 007 mission.

2711
02:01:31,590 --> 02:01:32,720
(Team P3 arrives at the street
under Bloody Mansion.)

2712
02:01:32,720 --> 02:01:34,190
Let's go straight to the main hall.

2713
02:01:34,790 --> 02:01:36,090
Team P1 is waiting for us...

2714
02:01:36,090 --> 02:01:37,360
