- Okay.

2718
02:01:44,300 --> 02:01:45,770
We'll try to sneak in
as quietly as possible.

2719
02:01:45,770 --> 02:01:49,140
We have to meet with them
in the main hall.

2720
02:01:49,770 --> 02:01:51,010
Be careful.

2721
02:01:51,540 --> 02:01:52,570
Go slowly.

2722
02:01:52,570 --> 02:01:54,340
- Someone is moving over there.
- Go slowly.

2723
02:01:54,880 --> 02:01:55,980
Check before we move.

2724
02:01:56,180 --> 02:01:58,250
