2763
02:03:52,060 --> 02:03:53,760
The safe in the main hall
and number three.

2764
02:03:53,760 --> 02:03:54,960
Oh, these two.

2765
02:03:55,230 --> 02:03:57,200
We talked about this before you guys came.

2766
02:03:57,300 --> 02:03:58,730
They won't know that you're here.

2767
02:03:58,730 --> 02:04:00,030
We'll also go,

2768
02:04:00,030 --> 02:04:01,640
"What? It's an ambush!"

2769
02:04:01,900 --> 02:04:03,740
- We have to look like enemies.
- We have to look like enemies.

2770
02:04:03,740 --> 02:04:05,010
- Right.
- Right.

2771
02:04:05,040 --> 02:04:07,810
Let's work out the scenario
in the order of time.

2772
02:04:07,810 --> 02:04:08,980
Right. Let's do that.

2773
02:04:09,280 --> 02:04:10,440
All right.

2774
02:04:10,440 --> 02:04:12,780
Number one is hidden deep by the pool.

2775
02:04:13,580 --> 02:04:16,320
(The pool is located
on the 3rd floor of the mansion.)

2776
02:04:16,580 --> 02:04:19,150
(Safe 1 is hidden somewhere here.)

2777
02:04:19,250 --> 02:04:20,420
(Pool)

2778
02:04:20,420 --> 02:04:21,720
The main hall is here.

2779
02:04:21,790 --> 02:04:25,630
We should go through the grass
where the machine room is.

2780
02:04:25,630 --> 02:04:27,490
(The exterior wall under the pool)

2781
02:04:28,630 --> 02:04:31,630
(The machine room is located
at the very end.)

2782
02:04:32,130 --> 02:04:34,170
After checking the hint for number one
right here,

2783
02:04:34,170 --> 02:04:35,540
we will climb up the ladder...

2784
02:04:35,540 --> 02:04:37,910
to open the safe by the pool.
This is the problem.

2785
02:04:37,910 --> 02:04:39,670
The moment we open it...

2786
02:04:39,670 --> 02:04:40,940
the siren will go off.

2787
02:04:41,210 --> 02:04:42,810
At that moment,

2788
02:04:43,310 --> 02:04:46,050
when we get told about the passcode
of second safe via phone,

2789
02:04:46,050 --> 02:04:47,920
- the people here must open it right away.
- Right away.

2790
02:04:47,920 --> 02:04:50,380
When the second safe is opened,
there will be money...

2791
02:04:50,380 --> 02:04:52,320
and a hint for the third safe.

2792
02:04:52,320 --> 02:04:53,920
Someone must get the money...

2793
02:04:53,920 --> 02:04:55,390
and you must deliver the passcode.

2794
02:04:55,420 --> 02:04:57,220
- That's how safe three can be opened.
- Okay.

2795
02:04:57,290 --> 02:04:58,960
All right. Let's run a simulation.

2796
02:04:58,960 --> 02:05:00,730
Who will go up to the pool?

2797
02:05:00,790 --> 02:05:03,400
All four of us will go to open it.

2798
02:05:03,530 --> 02:05:05,400
Hye Seon will be the only one
to come down after that.

2799
02:05:05,400 --> 02:05:07,330
After opening safe one,
Hye Seon will get the money...

2800
02:05:07,330 --> 02:05:08,940
and hide in the machine room.

2801
02:05:09,100 --> 02:05:10,440
Based on the situation,

2802
02:05:10,440 --> 02:05:11,710
the money will be thrown down to her...

2803
02:05:11,710 --> 02:05:13,870
and Hye Seon will keep
all of the money in the machine room.

2804
02:05:13,910 --> 02:05:15,540
- The other three...
- I will...

2805
02:05:15,540 --> 02:05:17,340
- give you a call.
- Right.

2806
02:05:17,340 --> 02:05:19,850
Let's say
there are people in the main hall.

2807
02:05:19,850 --> 02:05:21,110
The safe wasn't opened.

2808
02:05:21,110 --> 02:05:22,680
What will we do? Let's start with that.

2809
02:05:22,750 --> 02:05:24,050
I got the call and went in.

2810
02:05:24,050 --> 02:05:25,190
There are people inside.

2811
02:05:25,190 --> 02:05:27,090
"Hey, did you check the rooftop?"

2812
02:05:27,090 --> 02:05:30,460
"Hey, we have to quickly find
the intruders!"

2813
02:05:30,520 --> 02:05:32,530
- "Hey!"
- That might not work.

2814
02:05:32,530 --> 02:05:34,260
- Xitsuh should be in the main hall...
- Right.

2815
02:05:34,290 --> 02:05:36,300
and I'll go, "It's Xitsuh!"

2816
02:05:36,300 --> 02:05:38,170
You should go up
while showing yourself to everyone.

2817
02:05:38,330 --> 02:05:41,240
- That will make all of them go up.
- Right.

2818
02:05:41,300 --> 02:05:43,000
- That's when the safe should be opened.
- Okay.

2819
02:05:43,000 --> 02:05:45,070
You should go down and hide.

2820
02:05:45,070 --> 02:05:46,410
Protect the bag of money.

2821
02:05:46,710 --> 02:05:49,840
I will pretend to spot Xitsuh.

2822
02:05:49,840 --> 02:05:52,550
I'll go, "It's Xitsuh!"
That's when Xitsuh will run up.

2823
02:05:52,810 --> 02:05:55,280
Xitsuh will lure them upstairs...

2824
02:05:55,280 --> 02:05:58,520
and Tae Gyun will open safe two
while that happens.

2825
02:05:58,820 --> 02:06:02,390
I will be the one to keep the money safe.

2826
02:06:02,620 --> 02:06:05,060
We decided to go with that scenario.

2827
02:06:05,060 --> 02:06:07,490
- The three of you will move.
- Right.

2828
02:06:07,490 --> 02:06:09,300
- Xitsuh will stay here. Okay.
- Right.

2829
02:06:09,300 --> 02:06:10,800
Let's say I found the passcode.

2830
02:06:10,800 --> 02:06:12,200
I sent it to Seong Beom. What next?

2831
02:06:12,200 --> 02:06:14,640
- We'll be there at that time.
- Right.

2832
02:06:15,070 --> 02:06:16,770
The moment the siren is heard,

2833
02:06:16,770 --> 02:06:19,540
they will move here or here.

2834
02:06:19,540 --> 02:06:21,410
I definitely think
You Hyun and Kyoung Hoon...

2835
02:06:21,410 --> 02:06:23,810
will head to the rooftop
as the main hall is too obvious.

2836
02:06:23,810 --> 02:06:25,180
That's when Sang Min should...

2837
02:06:25,180 --> 02:06:27,480
- help us find the passcode.
- Right.

2838
02:06:27,480 --> 02:06:29,820
A diversion. Jin Ho and Sang Min
must bring them down...

2839
02:06:29,820 --> 02:06:32,450
for us to open safe 3 and safe 4.

2840
02:06:32,490 --> 02:06:34,590
This is what happens
when the last safe is opened.

2841
02:06:34,620 --> 02:06:37,060
- Let's say all four safes are opened.
- Right.

2842
02:06:37,060 --> 02:06:38,530
- The moment safe four opens,
- Right.

2843
02:06:38,630 --> 02:06:39,960
safe five will appear.

2844
02:06:40,090 --> 02:06:41,830
It isn't shown on the map.
But what's funny is that...

2845
02:06:41,830 --> 02:06:43,230
all of the safes
have 50,000 dollars in them.

2846
02:06:43,230 --> 02:06:44,870
But safe 5 has 200,000 dollars.

2847
02:06:45,200 --> 02:06:46,830
The moment the announcement
for safe five comes out,

2848
02:06:46,830 --> 02:06:49,240
we have to all rush over to open it.

2849
02:06:49,240 --> 02:06:51,570
It's game over the moment
safe five is opened.

2850
02:06:51,570 --> 02:06:54,170
- It belongs to the one who opens it.
- I see.

2851
02:06:54,240 --> 02:06:56,810
Listen up. I'll use a trick in the middle.

2852
02:06:56,980 --> 02:07:00,080
- There's a bag in my room.
- Right.

2853
02:07:00,080 --> 02:07:01,250
- In the bag,
- Right.

2854
02:07:01,250 --> 02:07:02,620
- I'll put in things like tissue paper.
- Okay.

2855
02:07:02,620 --> 02:07:04,080
- I'll pretend it's a bag of money...
- Right.

2856
02:07:04,080 --> 02:07:05,890
and I'll be constantly running around.

2857
02:07:05,890 --> 02:07:07,220
They will definitely think...

2858
02:07:07,220 --> 02:07:09,890
I'm the one with the bag of money
and chase after me.

2859
02:07:09,890 --> 02:07:11,490
- You'll be a decoy?
- Right.

2860
02:07:11,660 --> 02:07:13,660
I'll always be around.

2861
02:07:13,660 --> 02:07:15,630
I'll always be around all of you.

2862
02:07:15,730 --> 02:07:19,000
No. Keun Woo should stick with me.

2863
02:07:19,630 --> 02:07:21,370
I got very excited.

2864
02:07:21,370 --> 02:07:22,740
The opposing side...

2865
02:07:22,840 --> 02:07:24,840
only had seven members.

2866
02:07:25,570 --> 02:07:28,010
If we use our numbers to our advantage,

2867
02:07:28,710 --> 02:07:29,980
we can surely...

2868
02:07:29,980 --> 02:07:32,680
open the safes quickly.

2869
02:07:32,910 --> 02:07:34,150
Let's get going before it's too late.

2870
02:07:34,150 --> 02:07:35,250
Right. Let's hurry.

2871
02:07:35,250 --> 02:07:36,550
If the sun comes up,

2872
02:07:36,550 --> 02:07:38,650
- It will become dangerous.
- things will change.

2873
02:07:38,650 --> 02:07:40,350
- Let's move.
- Go.

2874
02:07:46,330 --> 02:07:47,460
Where was the machine room again?

2875
02:07:47,460 --> 02:07:48,730
It's that way.

2876
02:07:48,730 --> 02:07:51,200
I'll go up regardless of the situation.

2877
02:07:51,670 --> 02:07:52,670
Let's move.

2878
02:07:52,670 --> 02:07:57,100
(Team P3's Hye Seon, Jin Ho
and Seong Beom move to the machine room.)

2879
02:08:02,240 --> 02:08:04,180
My heart was about to explode.

2880
02:08:04,280 --> 02:08:08,180
It felt like we were going to get caught
on our way to the machine room.

2881
02:08:11,950 --> 02:08:14,860
I got so worried that we would
get caught on our way there.

2882
02:08:15,260 --> 02:08:18,460
I tried to move as fast as I could.

2883
02:08:19,030 --> 02:08:21,430
I tried my best
to get to the machine room quickly.

2884
02:08:22,000 --> 02:08:23,060
Gosh.

2885
02:08:31,340 --> 02:08:32,470
There's a ditch here.

2886
02:08:33,570 --> 02:08:34,640
Let's move this way.

2887
02:08:34,640 --> 02:08:36,480
This side is less steep.

2888
02:08:39,080 --> 02:08:41,420
The way to the machine room
on the grass...

2889
02:08:41,580 --> 02:08:43,750
can be seen from the pool.

2890
02:08:44,180 --> 02:08:46,090
I was wearing pink on top of that.

2891
02:08:46,520 --> 02:08:47,590
I feel so anxious.

2892
02:08:48,290 --> 02:08:50,290
- Where's the machine room?
- It's right there.

2893
02:08:50,290 --> 02:08:51,360
- That's the machine room?
- Right.

2894
02:08:51,560 --> 02:08:54,190
(Machine room)

2895
02:08:54,960 --> 02:08:57,660
(Meanwhile, in front of the cafeteria
on the 4th floor)

2896
02:09:06,470 --> 02:09:07,470
Is this the right place?

2897
02:09:07,570 --> 02:09:08,580
(Kim You Hyun)

2898
02:09:08,580 --> 02:09:10,310
Here it is. Come this way.
There are stairs.

2899
02:09:15,120 --> 02:09:18,590
(They enter the machine room.)

2900
02:09:21,760 --> 02:09:24,120
We had to find hints for the safe
in there.

2901
02:09:24,190 --> 02:09:25,430
(Machine room)

2902
02:09:31,500 --> 02:09:34,570
We brought a giant key with us.

2903
02:09:34,570 --> 02:09:38,040
We wondered, "How big is the safe
for the key to be this big?"

2904
02:09:38,770 --> 02:09:39,770
Are we looking for a place for the key?

2905
02:09:40,240 --> 02:09:42,210
- A place for the key?
- That...

2906
02:09:42,880 --> 02:09:43,880
or...

2907
02:09:46,450 --> 02:09:47,950
What? Was this here?

2908
02:09:47,950 --> 02:09:49,380
- Yes.
- What?

2909
02:09:49,580 --> 02:09:50,650
What's this then?

2910
02:09:50,650 --> 02:09:52,020
Do these two go together?

2911
02:09:52,390 --> 02:09:53,390
Are they linked or what?

2912
02:09:54,250 --> 02:09:55,720
Check if there are numbers.

2913
02:09:55,890 --> 02:09:56,890
Give it to me.

2914
02:10:02,030 --> 02:10:03,730
What? That's 37! That's 3725!

2915
02:10:03,730 --> 02:10:05,200
- It's 3752.
- It's 3752.

2916
02:10:05,200 --> 02:10:06,730
(Outdoor survival grounds key)

2917
02:10:06,730 --> 02:10:09,370
(Machine room key)

2918
02:10:09,370 --> 02:10:13,670
(The numbers shown with these two keys)

2919
02:10:13,740 --> 02:10:15,180
We brought a key...

2920
02:10:15,180 --> 02:10:17,340
and there was a key in the machine room.

2921
02:10:17,340 --> 02:10:19,510
When the two were placed together,

2922
02:10:19,510 --> 02:10:21,180
numbers were shown.

2923
02:10:21,380 --> 02:10:25,790
We realized that the numbers were
the passcode of the first safe.

2924
02:10:25,790 --> 02:10:27,750
That was when it started to feel real.

2925
02:10:28,020 --> 02:10:29,720
Once this passcode gets pressed,

2926
02:10:29,720 --> 02:10:32,790
this grand game will begin tonight.

2927
02:10:33,060 --> 02:10:34,460
- What? We got a call.
- We got a call.

2928
02:10:34,660 --> 02:10:36,460
- We got a call?
- Yes.

2929
02:10:36,460 --> 02:10:38,230
- Right.
- It's 3752.

2930
02:10:39,900 --> 02:10:40,900
Hello?

2931
02:10:42,000 --> 02:10:43,000
Seong Beom.

2932
02:10:43,000 --> 02:10:44,840
Tae Gyun, we got the numbers.

2933
02:10:44,840 --> 02:10:45,910
Oh, right.

2934
02:10:45,910 --> 02:10:48,110
We're going to open it now.

2935
02:10:48,110 --> 02:10:49,110
Right.

2936
02:10:49,180 --> 02:10:50,180
Hold on.

2937
02:10:50,510 --> 02:10:51,510
For now,

2938
02:10:51,850 --> 02:10:52,880
don't hang up and wait.

2939
02:10:52,880 --> 02:10:54,310
We might not be able
to reach each other later.

2940
02:10:54,310 --> 02:10:55,520
Okay.

2941
02:10:56,950 --> 02:10:58,290
- Go first.
- Okay.

2942
02:11:13,470 --> 02:11:14,800
That could be the case
if we stall for too long.

2943
02:11:14,800 --> 02:11:17,640
They might go, "Where are the others
other than Xitsuh?"

2944
02:11:17,640 --> 02:11:20,970
(One in charge of 2nd safe, Lee Tae Gyun)

2945
02:11:20,970 --> 02:11:23,780
(Force leader, Jeong Keun Woo)

2946
02:11:26,550 --> 02:11:27,880
But where's the safe?

2947
02:11:28,520 --> 02:11:30,320
The safe is supposed to be by the pool.

2948
02:11:40,290 --> 02:11:41,390
Is it in the tent?

2949
02:11:42,100 --> 02:11:43,330
We wondered...

2950
02:11:44,000 --> 02:11:45,830
where the first safe was.

2951
02:11:45,830 --> 02:11:46,830
Try going in.

2952
02:11:48,070 --> 02:11:49,870
It's here!

2953
02:11:52,540 --> 02:11:54,410
- Hold on!
- Yes?

2954
02:11:54,810 --> 02:11:56,310
Get ready for the siren.

2955
02:11:56,640 --> 02:11:58,380
- Hold on.
- I'm going to run when I see them.

2956
02:11:58,510 --> 02:11:59,510
Hold on.

2957
02:12:00,410 --> 02:12:02,420
Tae Gyun, I'm going to open it now.

2958
02:12:02,650 --> 02:12:03,750
Hold on.

2959
02:12:04,050 --> 02:12:06,420
I'll hide outside. Hold on.

2960
02:12:08,560 --> 02:12:10,320
Get ready.
I'm going to open it in ten seconds.

2961
02:12:10,660 --> 02:12:11,660
Okay.

2962
02:12:12,060 --> 02:12:13,730
Ten, nine,

2963
02:12:14,130 --> 02:12:15,860
eight, seven,

2964
02:12:16,230 --> 02:12:17,830
six, five,

2965
02:12:18,300 --> 02:12:20,230
four, three,

2966
02:12:20,470 --> 02:12:22,340
two, one,

2967
02:12:22,770 --> 02:12:24,470
zero, bam.

2968
02:12:30,210 --> 02:12:32,650
(The first safe gets opened.)

2969
02:12:49,630 --> 02:12:50,630
Go.

2970
02:12:53,670 --> 02:12:54,670
Gosh!

2971
02:12:56,470 --> 02:12:58,870
The first safe has been opened.

2972
02:13:00,110 --> 02:13:02,740
Please guard the Bloody Mansion's safe.

2973
02:13:04,680 --> 02:13:07,510
(Team R's room)

2974
02:13:09,320 --> 02:13:11,850
The first safe has been opened.

2975
02:13:12,620 --> 02:13:16,660
The heist of the players aiming
for the Bloody Mansion's safe begins.

2976
02:13:18,530 --> 02:13:20,390
Hurry!

2977
02:13:20,660 --> 02:13:21,660
Come here, Keun Woo!

2978
02:13:22,730 --> 02:13:24,400
Tank for him.

2979
02:13:24,400 --> 02:13:25,700
- Help us.
- Hey.

2980
02:13:27,470 --> 02:13:29,400
It will belong
to the Indoor Alliance Team.

2981
02:13:30,600 --> 02:13:34,440
However, the final safe...

2982
02:13:34,540 --> 02:13:38,480
I was going to hide in the machine room.

2983
02:13:39,150 --> 02:13:42,750
(Hye Seon runs toward the other side
of the machine room.)

2984
02:13:43,320 --> 02:13:46,450
The machine room is pretty far away
from the pool.

2985
02:13:46,450 --> 02:13:49,490
I decided to hide myself
at a place I can't be seen.

2986
02:13:49,490 --> 02:13:53,760
I moved as fast as I could
to a corner behind the pool.

2987
02:13:54,530 --> 02:13:57,130
I was worried that I would stand out
since I was wearing pink.

2988
02:13:57,130 --> 02:14:01,300
I covered my body
with a black sleeping bag while sitting.

2989
02:14:01,670 --> 02:14:05,270
I tried to disguise myself as a trash bag.

2990
02:14:06,810 --> 02:14:10,580
I stayed there with the thought
of wanting to protect the money.

2991
02:14:11,980 --> 02:14:13,580
- Please!
- It will belong...

2992
02:14:13,580 --> 02:14:14,980
to the Indoor Alliance Team.

2993
02:14:14,980 --> 02:14:16,220
After the safe was opened,

2994
02:14:16,420 --> 02:14:18,490
there was a passcode inside.

2995
02:14:18,490 --> 02:14:20,390
I was going to tell Tae Gyun
the passcode...

2996
02:14:20,390 --> 02:14:23,920
and head over to the third safe.

2997
02:14:23,920 --> 02:14:26,130
(He tries to contact Tae Gyun.)

2998
02:14:27,660 --> 02:14:29,360
They're here!

2999
02:14:29,560 --> 02:14:30,560
They're here!

3000
02:14:30,760 --> 02:14:32,530
The Team C members were there.

3001
02:14:33,070 --> 02:14:34,070
"What's with these people?"

3002
02:14:34,370 --> 02:14:35,940
"Why aren't they asleep at this hour?"

3003
02:14:35,940 --> 02:14:37,870
They're here!

3004
02:14:37,870 --> 02:14:39,810
- They're here!
- There!

3005
02:14:40,140 --> 02:14:41,710
Gosh, stop!

3006
02:14:42,310 --> 02:14:44,840
Hey, stop him!

3007
02:14:44,840 --> 02:14:46,280
- Stop him!
- Hey!

3008
02:14:46,280 --> 02:14:47,880
The money kept in the opened safe...

3009
02:14:49,820 --> 02:14:52,520
- It's 213510.
- It cannot be moved.

3010
02:14:53,390 --> 02:14:56,190
(He gets rid of the passcode.)

3011
02:14:56,790 --> 02:14:58,930
Why weren't you guys sleeping?

3012
02:14:58,930 --> 02:15:00,160
Why weren't you guys sleeping?

3013
02:15:00,160 --> 02:15:03,000
- You reek of alcohol!
- Hey, go!

3014
02:15:03,000 --> 02:15:05,170
- Hurry up and stop him!
- Gosh!

3015
02:15:05,170 --> 02:15:06,730
- It's open.
- I'll keep him, Seong Beom.

3016
02:15:06,730 --> 02:15:07,730
- What?
- I'll keep him.

3017
02:15:07,730 --> 02:15:09,170
What if it's opened?

3018
02:15:09,740 --> 02:15:10,740
What are you doing, Keun Woo?

3019
02:15:10,900 --> 02:15:12,540
Why are you blocking me? I'm on your side.

3020
02:15:12,540 --> 02:15:15,310
(While Keun Woo blocks Kyoung Hoon...)

3021
02:15:17,510 --> 02:15:18,510
Hey, Seong Beom.

3022
02:15:18,650 --> 02:15:20,310
It's 213510.

