3272
02:26:51,140 --> 02:26:52,270
Darn it.

3273
02:26:52,370 --> 02:26:53,770
The money bag... This is bad.

3274
02:26:53,840 --> 02:26:56,810
Actually, I prepared a fake money bag
in advance.

3275
02:26:56,810 --> 02:26:59,550
There were potatoes in a box,

3276
02:26:59,550 --> 02:27:01,180
so I put a lot of potatoes in a bag...

3277
02:27:01,210 --> 02:27:03,280
and made it look full.

3278
02:27:03,280 --> 02:27:04,520
Then I was hiding.

3279
02:27:07,390 --> 02:27:11,490
(Seung Yong approaches Xitsuh.)

3280
02:27:15,330 --> 02:27:16,800
(Laughing)

3281
02:27:16,800 --> 02:27:17,930
I...

3282
02:27:18,500 --> 02:27:20,430
Why does Ji Min seem unfazed?

3283
02:27:22,770 --> 02:27:24,140
What is it, Ji Min?

3284
02:27:24,570 --> 02:27:26,510
What? Why?

3285
02:27:26,670 --> 02:27:28,110
Gosh, I was hiding well.

3286
02:27:28,210 --> 02:27:29,840
Why? Didn't you see him?

3287
02:27:29,840 --> 02:27:31,580
- What?
- Didn't you see him?

3288
02:27:31,580 --> 02:27:32,780
Who is it?

3289
02:27:32,950 --> 02:27:34,080
I can't see.

3290
02:27:34,080 --> 02:27:35,210
Hi, Ji Min.

3291
02:27:35,310 --> 02:27:36,580
Isn't it Xitsuh?

3292
02:27:37,450 --> 02:27:38,950
I was dumbfounded.

3293
02:27:39,050 --> 02:27:41,920
Why did she lie when it was obvious?

3294
02:27:42,050 --> 02:27:43,960
It looked unnatural even to me too.

3295
02:27:44,160 --> 02:27:46,830
I decided to surrender...

3296
02:27:46,830 --> 02:27:48,490
and stall for time.

3297
02:27:48,490 --> 02:27:51,000
It was for the better.
Seung Yong was physically strong,

3298
02:27:51,000 --> 02:27:53,230
so I thought I'd pull my weight.

3299
02:27:53,230 --> 02:27:54,300
What is this?

3300
02:27:54,300 --> 02:27:55,530
You can't take this.

3301
02:27:55,700 --> 02:27:56,870
I'll give it to you later.

3302
02:27:57,040 --> 02:27:58,600
- What is it?
- No.

3303
02:27:58,600 --> 02:27:59,940
You can't.

3304
02:28:02,170 --> 02:28:03,240
I'm sorry.

3305
02:28:03,910 --> 02:28:05,010
No.

3306
02:28:05,380 --> 02:28:06,480
Please...

3307
02:28:09,750 --> 02:28:10,880
Turtle position.

3308
02:28:10,880 --> 02:28:13,450
Someone help me with this. Where are they?

3309
02:28:14,020 --> 02:28:15,990
Seung Yong spotted...

3310
02:28:15,990 --> 02:28:18,060
the fake money bag I made.

3311
02:28:18,060 --> 02:28:19,730
I knew it was fake,

3312
02:28:19,730 --> 02:28:21,130
but I wasn't going to say it was.

3313
02:28:21,130 --> 02:28:22,390
Why would I make it
if I was going to say that?

3314
02:28:22,390 --> 02:28:23,660
I guarded it.

3315
02:28:23,660 --> 02:28:24,930
Xitsuh...

3316
02:28:25,430 --> 02:28:26,530
No.

3317
02:28:26,630 --> 02:28:27,970
- Xitsuh is here.
- What is it?

3318
02:28:28,400 --> 02:28:29,770
Hey!

3319
02:28:32,240 --> 02:28:33,270
Are you okay?

3320
02:28:33,270 --> 02:28:34,440
- Gosh, that's...
- Got it.

3321
02:28:34,870 --> 02:28:37,010
It was tied to my hand,

3322
02:28:37,080 --> 02:28:39,880
so the string tied around my hand...

3323
02:28:39,880 --> 02:28:41,380
got tighter.

3324
02:28:41,380 --> 02:28:42,550
He obviously looked strong.

3325
02:28:42,550 --> 02:28:44,680
He was too strong.

3326
02:28:44,680 --> 02:28:48,620
It was tied tightly around my hand.

3327
02:28:49,020 --> 02:28:50,260
I felt excruciating pain.

3328
02:28:50,260 --> 02:28:52,830
Xitsuh wrapped his body around the bag
to protect it.

3329
02:28:53,790 --> 02:28:56,400
And Seung Yong ripped it off him.

3330
02:28:57,100 --> 02:28:58,360
He used his full power.

3331
02:28:58,460 --> 02:29:00,230
But he couldn't find out...

3332
02:29:00,230 --> 02:29:02,640
that I was on Xitsuh's side.

3333
02:29:02,740 --> 02:29:04,040
So I couldn't help him.

3334
02:29:04,040 --> 02:29:05,400
If I had it my way,

3335
02:29:05,400 --> 02:29:07,370
I wanted to punch Seung Yong.

3336
02:29:07,370 --> 02:29:08,740
I wanted to push him.

3337
02:29:09,210 --> 02:29:11,180
I thought Xitsuh shouldn't get attacked,

3338
02:29:11,180 --> 02:29:14,680
but my body couldn't keep up with my mind,

3339
02:29:14,950 --> 02:29:16,180
and that was so scary.

3340
02:29:16,950 --> 02:29:20,550
(Grunting)

3341
02:29:20,550 --> 02:29:22,050
Gosh, this isn't right.

3342
02:29:23,990 --> 02:29:25,490
The atmosphere...

3343
02:29:25,560 --> 02:29:28,260
seemed different...

3344
02:29:28,260 --> 02:29:29,330
from what I thought.

3345
02:29:29,430 --> 02:29:31,860
I was going for WWE,

3346
02:29:31,860 --> 02:29:33,770
but he came at me like it was UFC.

3347
02:29:34,470 --> 02:29:36,370
The pain in my hand didn't go away,

3348
02:29:36,370 --> 02:29:37,770
so I couldn't do anything.

3349
02:29:38,300 --> 02:29:42,910
(Seung Yong stole the fake money bag.)

3350
02:29:44,580 --> 02:29:45,810
What happened?

3351
02:29:46,780 --> 02:29:48,050
An ambush.

3352
02:29:48,680 --> 02:29:49,920
What is that?

3353
02:29:53,920 --> 02:29:55,650
I opened the bag and checked.

3354
02:29:55,650 --> 02:29:57,920
There were potatoes
and useless things inside.

3355
02:29:58,060 --> 02:29:59,430
I thought, "Why did they hide this?"

3356
02:29:59,430 --> 02:30:01,830
"Why didn't he give it to me?"

3357
02:30:02,460 --> 02:30:06,630
(While the indoor alliance is defending
the mansion)

3358
02:30:06,630 --> 02:30:07,830
Hey!

3359
02:30:08,370 --> 02:30:09,570
Beom.

3360
02:30:10,440 --> 02:30:13,270
Beom! Get up!

3361
02:30:13,270 --> 02:30:15,510
You need to get up! Come. Get up now.

3362
02:30:16,580 --> 02:30:18,580
- Beom, we got ambushed.
- What?

3363
02:30:18,580 --> 02:30:20,850
We got ambushed. They broke in.

3364
02:30:20,910 --> 02:30:21,950
- For real.
- What are you saying?

3365
02:30:21,950 --> 02:30:24,920
Team P1 and the others
broke into the mansion.

3366
02:30:24,920 --> 02:30:26,220
We need to protect our safes.

3367
02:30:26,990 --> 02:30:28,590
- They broke in?
- Yes.

3368
02:30:28,590 --> 02:30:29,890
Put your shoes on.

3369
02:30:30,290 --> 02:30:33,030
Put your shoes on.
Team P1 isn't on our side.

3370
02:30:33,090 --> 02:30:34,660
- Team P1 isn't on our side.
- They're not.

3371
02:30:34,660 --> 02:30:37,100
Yes, and remember Team P3
that went to the outdoor survival grounds?

3372
02:30:37,160 --> 02:30:39,160
Jin Ho's team. They're not on our side.

3373
02:30:39,260 --> 02:30:40,530
- Just block them.
- Okay.

3374
02:30:40,530 --> 02:30:42,000
Stop them from opening the safe, okay?

3375
02:30:42,000 --> 02:30:43,770
Let's go.

3376
02:30:44,940 --> 02:30:45,940
Yes?

3377
02:30:49,010 --> 02:30:50,310
Darn it.

3378
02:31:04,560 --> 02:31:07,160
I was sleeping when someone woke me.

3379
02:31:08,230 --> 02:31:11,230
I saw his face, and he was so rushed.

3380
02:31:11,300 --> 02:31:12,460
I mean, You Hyun was.

3381
02:31:12,730 --> 02:31:15,200
"Beom, it's an ambush!"

3382
02:31:16,100 --> 02:31:18,270
I was like, "What is he talking about?"

3383
02:31:19,670 --> 02:31:22,240
So I took my time and went out.

3384
02:31:22,740 --> 02:31:24,980
- Was it cracked?
- No, not yet.

3385
02:31:24,980 --> 02:31:25,980
They didn't crack it yet.

3386
02:31:25,980 --> 02:31:27,650
I think they haven't.

3387
02:31:27,650 --> 02:31:28,850
You could...

3388
02:31:29,450 --> 02:31:30,850
stay here,

3389
02:31:30,850 --> 02:31:32,450
or you could tell the others.

3390
02:31:32,450 --> 02:31:33,690
He told me to do that.

3391
02:31:36,860 --> 02:31:38,990
"Beom, guard this, at least."

3392
02:31:39,290 --> 02:31:41,390
I knew about the one in the main hall.

3393
02:31:41,490 --> 02:31:42,730
Other than that one.

3394
02:31:44,030 --> 02:31:45,900
The one on the rooftop,

3395
02:31:45,900 --> 02:31:47,300
the one by the pool,

3396
02:31:47,300 --> 02:31:48,400
and the one in the pantry.

3397
02:31:50,000 --> 02:31:51,800
Isn't it so chilling?

3398
02:31:53,110 --> 02:31:54,610
That there were safes?

3399
02:32:04,220 --> 02:32:09,190
(Only 30 minutes remain for the heist.)

3400
02:32:09,190 --> 02:32:12,290
(Only 30 minutes remain for the heist.)

3401
02:32:12,990 --> 02:32:14,960
I wondered why time went so slowly.

3402
02:32:24,640 --> 02:32:26,470
Why is 30 minutes so long?

3403
02:32:26,470 --> 02:32:27,740
(He earned 30 dollars.)

3404
02:32:31,910 --> 02:32:36,480
(Cafeteria where the 4th safe is located)

3405
02:32:36,980 --> 02:32:38,450
As I expected,

3406
02:32:38,450 --> 02:32:40,920
I found the safe
when I lifted the tablecloth.

3407
02:32:42,050 --> 02:32:43,490
Then it hit me...

3408
02:32:43,490 --> 02:32:45,890
that I brought only one money bag.

3409
02:32:45,960 --> 02:32:48,260
After I put the money from the rooftop
in a bag and threw it,

3410
02:32:48,260 --> 02:32:50,360
there was nothing to put the money in.

3411
02:32:50,730 --> 02:32:52,630
So I immediately thought of...

3412
02:32:55,800 --> 02:32:59,070
putting the money in the ramyeon box
and throwing it.

3413
02:33:10,780 --> 02:33:12,890
I hid where no one could see me...

3414
02:33:13,090 --> 02:33:16,290
and opened the scroll
and checked the passcode.

3415
02:33:18,190 --> 02:33:20,690
(Tae Gyun)

3416
02:33:21,430 --> 02:33:22,730
It's 635...

3417
02:33:30,740 --> 02:33:32,270
Everyone knows it's here.

3418
02:33:32,270 --> 02:33:34,470
I know where it is,
but I'm not sure about the passcode.

3419
02:33:34,870 --> 02:33:36,070
We need to solve it.

3420
02:33:41,380 --> 02:33:43,580
(Tae Gyun was found.)

3421
02:33:45,320 --> 02:33:47,220
I took the ramyeon box...

3422
02:33:47,320 --> 02:33:49,220
and was about to open the safe.

3423
02:33:49,220 --> 02:33:51,860
One of them ran into the cafeteria.

3424
02:33:53,330 --> 02:33:54,630
I thought I got busted.

3425
02:33:55,690 --> 02:33:57,800
My first instinct was to run away...

3426
02:33:57,800 --> 02:33:59,300
rather than open the safe.

3427
02:33:59,300 --> 02:34:01,500
I was the only one who knew...

3428
02:34:01,500 --> 02:34:03,100
about the money bag I threw
from the rooftop.

3429
02:34:03,100 --> 02:34:04,270
If I got caught then,

3430
02:34:04,270 --> 02:34:05,800
we wouldn't be able
to take that money either.

3431
02:34:05,840 --> 02:34:07,140
I thought I should look for a chance...

3432
02:34:07,810 --> 02:34:10,180
a while later.

3433
02:34:10,210 --> 02:34:12,080
So I went back to the basement.

3434
02:34:13,210 --> 02:34:16,780
(Tae Gyun came to the basement.)

3435
02:34:16,880 --> 02:34:18,580
I threw a money bag there.

3436
02:34:18,580 --> 02:34:19,920
Come here.

3437
02:34:23,220 --> 02:34:26,390
(Retrieving the money bag)

3438
02:34:35,900 --> 02:34:37,070
All right.

3439
02:34:37,070 --> 02:34:38,640
- We have only one left.
- What happened?

3440
02:34:38,640 --> 02:34:39,670
What?

3441
02:34:39,670 --> 02:34:40,870
- The one in the cafeteria.
- Wait.

3442
02:34:40,870 --> 02:34:42,010
The 4th one or the 5th one?

3443
02:34:42,010 --> 02:34:43,040
- I need to hold onto it.
- The fourth one.

3444
02:34:43,040 --> 02:34:44,080
The fourth one?

3445
02:34:44,240 --> 02:34:47,580
They figured out that we're
in the outdoor alliance.

3446
02:34:48,010 --> 02:34:49,280
They figured it out?

3447
02:34:57,260 --> 02:34:59,830
I took two money bags...

3448
02:35:00,130 --> 02:35:03,100
and put them in the garbage can
in the corner.

3449
02:35:03,500 --> 02:35:06,470
But I found it quite hard.

3450
02:35:06,930 --> 02:35:10,240
We couldn't just steal the money
and keep it somewhere.

3451
02:35:10,800 --> 02:35:14,240
We had to keep it for an hour
after stealing the money.

3452
02:35:14,910 --> 02:35:16,710
(Sighing)

3453
02:35:18,610 --> 02:35:20,380
Darn. What do I do?

3454
02:35:22,450 --> 02:35:25,320
I didn't know what was going on upstairs.

3455
02:35:25,980 --> 02:35:28,590
Tae Gyun told me to guard the bags...

3456
02:35:28,590 --> 02:35:30,020
and hide.

3457
02:35:30,020 --> 02:35:31,660
But there was nowhere for me to hide.

3458
02:35:32,060 --> 02:35:35,960
I thought I should take the money bags
from the garbage can...

3459
02:35:35,960 --> 02:35:37,730
and hide in my room.

3460
02:35:37,960 --> 02:35:39,900
Sang Min came down just in time.

3461
02:35:42,370 --> 02:35:44,570
Sang Min, about the money bags...

3462
02:35:44,800 --> 02:35:46,140
I should keep them.

3463
02:35:46,140 --> 02:35:47,540
Where are the money bags?

3464
02:35:50,410 --> 02:35:51,810
You can just stay in there.

3465
02:35:53,610 --> 02:35:56,380
- I think they'll come for me...
- What?

3466
02:35:56,380 --> 02:35:57,780
if I'm in there with the bags.

3467
02:35:58,120 --> 02:36:00,190
Can I go to my room with the money bags?

3468
02:36:00,520 --> 02:36:01,590
- You?
- Yes.

3469
02:36:02,490 --> 02:36:05,260
Could you cover for me
so I can go to my room?

3470
02:36:06,530 --> 02:36:09,330
I'll carry one of them first to my room.

3471
02:36:09,330 --> 02:36:11,060
No, you shouldn't take them.
You'll get caught.

3472
02:36:11,160 --> 02:36:12,630
Take the bags and go to our room.

3473
02:36:13,000 --> 02:36:14,470
Go to our room...

3474
02:36:14,470 --> 02:36:15,970
- since your room is on the 3rd floor.
- You want me to go to the 3rd floor?

3475
02:36:16,540 --> 02:36:18,270
No, our room on the first floor.

3476
02:36:20,340 --> 02:36:26,140
(Ji Min takes 2 money bags and moves.)

3477
02:36:36,390 --> 02:36:38,690
Sang Min!

3478
02:36:39,290 --> 02:36:42,960
Sang Min!

3479
02:36:45,500 --> 02:36:46,530
Sang Min!

3480
02:36:49,030 --> 02:36:50,600
Let go!

3481
02:36:52,470 --> 02:36:54,540
- Let go.
- Let go.

3482
02:36:54,540 --> 02:36:55,810
Oh, this is Xitsuh's.

3483
02:36:56,440 --> 02:36:57,810
- Let go.
- Hey.

3484
02:36:58,240 --> 02:36:59,710
Be careful.

3485
02:37:01,550 --> 02:37:02,950
Let go.

3486
02:37:04,180 --> 02:37:05,550
- Hey!
- It hurts!

3487
02:37:05,550 --> 02:37:07,450
Hey, we'll get hurt.

3488
02:37:07,990 --> 02:37:09,090
We'll get hurt.

3489
02:37:09,220 --> 02:37:11,790
On the way to the room
with the money bags,

3490
02:37:13,430 --> 02:37:15,860
I ran into Seung Yong,

3491
02:37:16,230 --> 02:37:17,700
of all people.

3492
02:37:18,460 --> 02:37:20,430
I almost wet my pants.

3493
02:37:21,200 --> 02:37:22,400
Oh, this is Xitsuh's.

3494
02:37:23,070 --> 02:37:24,470
- Let go.
- Hey.

3495
02:37:24,800 --> 02:37:27,040
We'll get hurt.

3496
02:37:28,140 --> 02:37:29,640
We'll get hurt. Hey.

3497
02:37:30,780 --> 02:37:32,210
- Hey!
- It hurts!

3498
02:37:32,210 --> 02:37:34,080
Hey, we'll get hurt.

3499
02:37:34,580 --> 02:37:35,750
We'll get hurt.

3500
02:37:36,210 --> 02:37:37,380
Hey, we'll get hurt.

3501
02:37:39,280 --> 02:37:40,490
Hey, just take this.

3502
02:37:45,360 --> 02:37:48,390
The one who helped me happened
to be an elderly. It was Sang Min.

3503
02:37:48,390 --> 02:37:50,860
So we couldn't guard it.

3504
02:37:51,160 --> 02:37:52,900
I wished it were Keun Woo or Tae Gyun...

3505
02:37:52,900 --> 02:37:54,870
guarding me from Seung Yong.

3506
02:37:55,300 --> 02:37:58,640
Sang Min was thrown into the air
right away.

3507
02:37:58,970 --> 02:38:00,540
He had only one goal.

3508
02:38:01,040 --> 02:38:04,440
His goal was to find
what he needed to find.

3509
02:38:04,810 --> 02:38:06,650
He went all crazy,
trying to steal the money bags.

3510
02:38:06,650 --> 02:38:09,180
I pretended like I wouldn't let it go
until the end,

3511
02:38:09,180 --> 02:38:11,320
but he took it in the end...

3512
02:38:11,320 --> 02:38:14,390
and threw it on the ground.

3513
02:38:18,020 --> 02:38:19,690
What? We're done for. Put it back in.

3514
02:38:25,100 --> 02:38:27,930
I didn't know what was in the bag exactly
when I touched it.

3515
02:38:28,370 --> 02:38:32,470
I wondered if it was filled with potatoes
like the ones I found earlier.

3516
02:38:32,470 --> 02:38:35,070
I spilled the contents
and checked it right away.

3517
02:38:35,270 --> 02:38:40,210
I realized what was in the safe
was money bundles.

3518
02:38:42,610 --> 02:38:45,180
I took them, but there were too many.

3519
02:38:45,180 --> 02:38:48,950
I just gave up and moved upstairs.

3520
02:38:54,230 --> 02:38:55,330
How annoying.

3521
02:38:56,090 --> 02:38:57,430
It's okay. We just need to put it back in.

3522
02:38:57,760 --> 02:38:58,930
Gosh, it hurts.

3523
02:39:01,300 --> 02:39:02,400
It hurts so much.

3524
02:39:05,840 --> 02:39:07,110
Others might come.

3525
02:39:09,980 --> 02:39:12,940
It hurts so much. That jerk is dead meat.

3526
02:39:14,180 --> 02:39:16,110
- Good job.
- I'll kill that jerk tomorrow.

3527
02:39:18,150 --> 02:39:20,950
- What is it?
- We need to take money from him.

3528
02:39:22,720 --> 02:39:24,660
(Tae Gyun follows Seung Yong.)

3529
02:39:24,660 --> 02:39:25,690
Keun Woo!

3530
02:39:26,260 --> 02:39:27,360
Keun Woo!

3531
02:39:30,730 --> 02:39:32,200
Get him!

3532
02:39:33,370 --> 02:39:34,430
Get him!

3533
02:39:39,910 --> 02:39:41,770
He's running away! Come quick!

3534
02:39:41,770 --> 02:39:43,610
- Hey, stop it.
- You'll get hurt.

3535
02:39:43,610 --> 02:39:45,580
Throw it here.

3536
02:39:45,980 --> 02:39:47,150
Throw it here.

3537
02:39:47,480 --> 02:39:48,480
Darn it!

3538
02:39:52,280 --> 02:39:54,320
Hey! Oh, okay.

3539
02:39:55,050 --> 02:39:56,350
Don't let them get you.

3540
02:39:56,590 --> 02:39:57,990
Hold onto it.

3541
02:39:58,860 --> 02:40:00,660
That's enough.

3542
02:40:01,360 --> 02:40:03,530
Hey! Stop it.

3543
02:40:03,600 --> 02:40:05,160
Let's go down and talk.

3544
02:40:05,160 --> 02:40:06,730
- Let go.
- Stop it.

3545
02:40:06,730 --> 02:40:08,670
Okay. I won't pull. Let go!

3546
02:40:08,670 --> 02:40:09,900
- We're done here.
- I won't pull.

3547
02:40:09,900 --> 02:40:11,400
I won't pull.

3548
02:40:11,570 --> 02:40:14,270
Tae Gyun, just let him go.

3549
02:40:14,340 --> 02:40:15,810
End it here. It's over.

3550
02:40:15,910 --> 02:40:17,510
- It's over.
- He's on our side.

3551
02:40:17,580 --> 02:40:19,010
I know, so just end it here.

3552
02:40:19,310 --> 02:40:20,450
Don't do anything more.

3553
02:40:20,650 --> 02:40:22,480
Xitsuh was going to be the bait,

3554
02:40:22,480 --> 02:40:24,080
but he got caught.

3555
02:40:24,280 --> 02:40:25,550
His hand was all scraped up.

3556
02:40:25,550 --> 02:40:27,350
Xitsuh came bleeding,

3557
02:40:27,350 --> 02:40:29,120
and he was getting treated by the doctor.

3558
02:40:29,450 --> 02:40:32,820
Ji Min was thrown
over Seung Yong's shoulder.

3559
02:40:33,590 --> 02:40:35,960
From what I heard, Sang Min...

3560
02:40:36,230 --> 02:40:38,400
was also thrown over Seung Yong's shoulder
while stopping him.

3561
02:40:39,100 --> 02:40:41,770
I was really annoyed by the situation.

3562
02:40:42,200 --> 02:40:44,540
So I told them...

3563
02:40:45,740 --> 02:40:47,270
that we should stop opening the safes.

3564
02:40:47,770 --> 02:40:49,470
Hey, Kyoung Hoon and Seung Yong.

3565
02:40:49,470 --> 02:40:50,980
Just take the money
and go back to your room.

3566
02:40:50,980 --> 02:40:52,040
- Yes.
- Just go to your room.

3567
02:40:52,040 --> 02:40:53,510
Hey, go back to your room.

3568
02:40:53,510 --> 02:40:55,780
- Hurry up and go to your room.
- We're on the same side. Go to your room.

3569
02:40:55,910 --> 02:40:57,850
Do you know where Sang Min is?

3570
02:40:58,920 --> 02:41:02,450
(In front of the main hall)

3571
02:41:08,060 --> 02:41:12,660
(Sang Min is still picking up the money.)

3572
02:41:12,660 --> 02:41:14,970
It was my first time picking up money
on the asphalt.

3573
02:41:15,670 --> 02:41:17,000
I couldn't gather them.

3574
02:41:17,670 --> 02:41:20,140
The fake bills were too crisp,
so I couldn't gather them.

3575
02:41:21,040 --> 02:41:23,070
I had to scrape them up 1 by 1.

3576
02:41:24,040 --> 02:41:26,780
I kept putting the money in the bag.

3577
02:41:27,450 --> 02:41:30,050
I put it in my clothes while lying down.

3578
02:41:30,750 --> 02:41:32,380
I kept putting it in.

3579
02:41:43,060 --> 02:41:45,100
Gosh, I can't believe this.

3580
02:41:50,870 --> 02:41:52,240
What is this?

3581
02:41:53,000 --> 02:41:54,970
I was putting the money in my clothes
by myself.

3582
02:41:55,310 --> 02:41:56,840
Then You Hyun came over.

3583
02:42:03,250 --> 02:42:07,320
Sang Min, don't do this.

3584
02:42:07,320 --> 02:42:09,020
- Okay.
- Let's just go.

3585
02:42:09,020 --> 02:42:10,660
- No, I...
- I'll help you up.

3586
02:42:10,660 --> 02:42:11,690
No.

3587
02:42:11,920 --> 02:42:14,190
- Where are we going?
- Somewhere to sit.

3588
02:42:14,430 --> 02:42:15,590
I'll help you up.

3589
02:42:15,590 --> 02:42:17,060
- Give me my hat.
- Oh, I'm sorry.

3590
02:42:18,760 --> 02:42:19,900
Here you go.

3591
02:42:20,770 --> 02:42:22,800
- I'll help you. I'm sorry.
- It's fine.

3592
02:42:23,270 --> 02:42:24,770
I went to the 1st floor for the 1st time,

3593
02:42:24,770 --> 02:42:26,570
and Sang Min was sprawled on the ground.

3594
02:42:27,040 --> 02:42:31,680
His face showed
that he was in excruciating pain.

3595
02:42:31,880 --> 02:42:36,050
So I helped him up...

3596
02:42:36,050 --> 02:42:38,820
and told him that I would put him
on the sofa in the pantry.

3597
02:42:39,220 --> 02:42:41,150
- I'll be lying on the sofa.
- Okay.

3598
02:42:41,490 --> 02:42:43,020
I'll go with you.

3599
02:42:44,190 --> 02:42:46,190
- Gosh, I think I need to...
- Are you okay?

3600
02:42:46,390 --> 02:42:47,860
I need to go to the hospital.

3601
02:42:51,760 --> 02:42:54,770
Gosh. It's just a game. Did we have to...

3602
02:42:57,270 --> 02:42:59,100
Did we have to go
that far just for a game?

3603
02:42:59,870 --> 02:43:01,740
I've never played a game like this either.

3604
02:43:04,580 --> 02:43:08,850
I was really worried about Sang Min
getting hurt.

3605
02:43:11,850 --> 02:43:17,660
(Kyoung Hoon came to the main hall
to look for the safe.)

3606
02:43:19,890 --> 02:43:22,190
What are you doing? Are you okay?

3607
02:43:22,630 --> 02:43:23,700
Darn...

3608
02:43:23,900 --> 02:43:25,260
You must be really hurt.

3609
02:43:25,500 --> 02:43:28,000
I asked the medical staff to come.

3610
02:43:28,270 --> 02:43:29,770
- You called them?
- Yes.

3611
02:43:31,100 --> 02:43:32,900
You're not hiding, are you?

3612
02:43:39,310 --> 02:43:40,810
You're acting, aren't you?

3613
02:43:41,280 --> 02:43:43,250
I called the medical staff.

3614
02:43:43,250 --> 02:43:45,250
I told You Hyun about this, you punk.

3615
02:43:45,720 --> 02:43:47,220
Really? Okay.

3616
02:43:53,730 --> 02:43:57,530
(Peeking)

3617
02:43:59,460 --> 02:44:03,470
(Dropping to the floor)

3618
02:44:08,510 --> 02:44:09,670
I...

3619
02:44:10,140 --> 02:44:12,410
I feel like there must be a reason
you're lying down here.

3620
02:44:12,410 --> 02:44:13,810
- There isn't.
- Okay.

3621
02:44:14,180 --> 02:44:15,450
- Got it?
- Yes.

3622
02:44:16,880 --> 02:44:17,880
I didn't tell him,

3623
02:44:17,880 --> 02:44:19,880
but I was very worried about him
on the inside.

3624
02:44:19,920 --> 02:44:22,320
But what can you do?
That's just how the game is.

3625
02:44:22,950 --> 02:44:25,520
(Guard the safe.)

3626
02:44:25,520 --> 02:44:27,030
(If you open the safe, the 50,000 dollars
should be with contact to your body...)

3627
02:44:27,030 --> 02:44:28,130
(to be admitted that it was acquired.)

3628
02:44:34,630 --> 02:44:36,800
I'm going to head over to the first floor.

3629
02:44:37,570 --> 02:44:38,670
I'll go with you.

3630
02:44:40,770 --> 02:44:42,040
How many minutes are left?

3631
02:44:42,540 --> 02:44:43,840
- I don't know.
- Gosh.

3632
02:44:43,840 --> 02:44:44,910
I haven't been paying attention.

3633
02:44:44,910 --> 02:44:46,480
What is he doing right now?

3634
02:44:46,480 --> 02:44:47,850
Beom must be guarding it.

3635
02:44:49,880 --> 02:44:51,420
It shouldn’t matter if we go over there,
right?

3636
02:44:54,950 --> 02:44:56,490
I mean, there's nothing here anyway.

3637
02:44:56,550 --> 02:44:57,790
There's nothing here.

3638
02:44:59,820 --> 02:45:01,230
Are you acting as the gatekeeper?

3639
02:45:04,960 --> 02:45:08,970
(Cautious)

3640
02:45:09,300 --> 02:45:10,570
Is there something inside?

3641
02:45:10,670 --> 02:45:12,500
- If it's anything good, let's split it.
- Let's stay together.

3642
02:45:12,940 --> 02:45:15,570
Look at how seriously he's blocking us.

3643
02:45:15,570 --> 02:45:16,810
There's nothing there.

3644
02:45:16,810 --> 02:45:17,880
You look so cool.

3645
02:45:18,480 --> 02:45:23,110
(Doing his best to carry out his mission)

3646
02:45:26,780 --> 02:45:27,850
Gosh, I'm tired.

3647
02:45:30,190 --> 02:45:32,060
This place has already been looted.

3648
02:45:32,860 --> 02:45:34,290
Why is he guarding it?

3649
02:45:38,630 --> 02:45:42,270
(Seong Beom hangs around the main hall.)

3650
02:45:42,400 --> 02:45:43,570
Keun Woo.

3651
02:45:44,800 --> 02:45:45,800
Keun Woo.

3652
02:45:45,800 --> 02:45:47,540
I'm going to go around and...

3653
02:45:47,710 --> 02:45:49,710
I'm going to go around and enter
through the machine room and open it.

3654
02:45:49,710 --> 02:45:50,980
Can you catch it if I throw you the money?

3655
02:45:50,980 --> 02:45:52,340
- Let's go together.
- Okay.

3656
02:45:52,480 --> 02:45:53,680
It's 635250.

3657
02:45:54,180 --> 02:45:55,450
I figured I'd have to...

3658
02:45:55,450 --> 02:45:57,020
open the fourth safe.

3659
02:45:57,020 --> 02:45:59,180
I thought I'd open it and take the money,

3660
02:45:59,180 --> 02:46:00,790
so I discreetly asked Tae Gyun.

3661
02:46:01,350 --> 02:46:03,790
(While everyone was distracted
at the 1st-floor staircase)

3662
02:46:03,790 --> 02:46:05,120
What's the passcode?

3663
02:46:05,120 --> 02:46:06,390
It's 635250.

3664
02:46:09,660 --> 02:46:11,630
As planned, we have no choice
but to open the fourth safe.

3665
02:46:11,630 --> 02:46:13,230
I kept thinking that...

3666
02:46:13,230 --> 02:46:15,330
I need to do my part properly right now...

3667
02:46:15,330 --> 02:46:17,670
so that the team's strategy
could actually work.

3668
02:46:17,970 --> 02:46:19,470
It's 635250.

3669
02:46:19,600 --> 02:46:21,210
It's 635250.

3670
02:46:21,610 --> 02:46:22,940
It's 635250.

3671
02:46:39,190 --> 02:46:44,930
(The two approach carefully.)

3672
02:46:49,800 --> 02:46:52,970
As I went around behind
the machine room and headed upstairs,

3673
02:46:53,270 --> 02:46:56,370
there weren't many people
on my way to the cafeteria.

3674
02:46:59,580 --> 02:47:04,720
(Keun Woo makes his way
straight to the cafeteria.)

3675
02:47:16,090 --> 02:47:18,400
If we don't secure the money,

3676
02:47:18,760 --> 02:47:20,570
it'll end up going to our opponents.

3677
02:47:20,570 --> 02:47:21,830
We have to protect it no matter what.

3678
02:47:21,830 --> 02:47:23,900
Anyone can see that
we absolutely have to open this.

3679
02:47:46,520 --> 02:47:48,730
Heist Day has now ended.

3680
02:47:48,730 --> 02:47:51,630
All players,
please gather in the main hall.

3681
02:47:56,100 --> 02:47:57,240
Gosh.

3682
02:47:57,900 --> 02:47:58,970
Gosh.

3683
02:48:07,750 --> 02:48:10,580
After hearing the announcement
that the heist was over,

3684
02:48:10,680 --> 02:48:12,550
I headed downstairs...

3685
02:48:12,550 --> 02:48:15,650
carrying the 50,000 dollars
that I'd managed to keep safe.

3686
02:48:21,490 --> 02:48:23,290
You did that to Sang Min? Come here.

3687
02:48:23,390 --> 02:48:25,160
I think he's really in pain.

3688
02:48:30,470 --> 02:48:32,770
He injured his ankle. He can't get up.

3689
02:48:32,970 --> 02:48:34,940
- I'm so sorry.
- No, it's fine.

3690
02:48:34,940 --> 02:48:36,770
- I'm so sorry.
- It's fine.

3691
02:48:36,840 --> 02:48:39,410
No, it happens.

3692
02:48:39,580 --> 02:48:41,550
That's just how this kind of game is.

3693
02:48:42,350 --> 02:48:43,850
I realized...

3694
02:48:43,980 --> 02:48:46,020
I got way too overly immersed...

3695
02:48:46,020 --> 02:48:47,290
in the game.

3696
02:48:47,420 --> 02:48:49,320
There was a line...

3697
02:48:49,490 --> 02:48:53,290
that I shouldn't have been crossed,
but I think I crossed it.

3698
02:48:54,090 --> 02:48:55,730
So I felt really sorry.

3699
02:48:56,660 --> 02:48:59,300
That was when I realized that
the situation was...

3700
02:48:59,300 --> 02:49:01,230
more serious than I'd thought.

3701
02:49:02,070 --> 02:49:03,530
I was outside. He saw me.

3702
02:49:03,530 --> 02:49:05,840
You know what I did?
I tried to go with a WWE strategy,

3703
02:49:05,840 --> 02:49:08,840
so I was hugging the fake money bag...

3704
02:49:08,840 --> 02:49:10,940
and holding the turtle position.

3705
02:49:10,940 --> 02:49:12,540
He came at me trying to take it,

3706
02:49:12,540 --> 02:49:13,980
and now my hands are all messed up.

3707
02:49:13,980 --> 02:49:15,210
But that was fake.

3708
02:49:15,210 --> 02:49:16,450
Yes, it was a fake bag.

3709
02:49:16,450 --> 02:49:18,680
Even if it was fake,
he could have thought it was real.

3710
02:49:18,680 --> 02:49:20,380
But still, I was just curled up
in the turtle position...

3711
02:49:20,380 --> 02:49:23,050
and he wrecked my hands
trying to take it from me.

3712
02:49:23,590 --> 02:49:25,660
And then they were worrying about
Seung Yong being hurt.

3713
02:49:25,660 --> 02:49:27,760
Gosh, it was so messed up...

3714
02:49:27,760 --> 02:49:29,290
that I'm starting to get annoyed.

3715
02:49:30,800 --> 02:49:32,360
Can you believe this?

3716
02:49:32,360 --> 02:49:34,330
Sometimes, I think...

3717
02:49:35,100 --> 02:49:36,730
I am angry.

3718
02:49:37,340 --> 02:49:38,340
First of all,

3719
02:49:38,340 --> 02:49:40,610
he just walked away
without even checking if I was okay...

3720
02:49:41,140 --> 02:49:42,440
or apologizing.

3721
02:49:43,710 --> 02:49:45,780
To be honest, I don't even think
he's worth dealing with.

3722
02:49:45,780 --> 02:49:47,550
Right now, he seems inhuman.

3723
02:49:47,810 --> 02:49:49,280
I see him as an animal.

3724
02:49:49,850 --> 02:49:51,720
Hey, no one got hurt, right?

3725
02:49:52,420 --> 02:49:53,450
You're...

3726
02:49:53,450 --> 02:49:55,150
the only one who should be fine.

3727
02:49:55,150 --> 02:49:57,360
- Goodness.
- I'm okay.

3728
02:50:00,320 --> 02:50:02,190
Did you hurt your hands?

3729
02:50:03,690 --> 02:50:05,360
This is from yesterday...

3730
02:50:05,430 --> 02:50:06,660
and I don't know how this happened.

3731
02:50:07,330 --> 02:50:09,700
How do you always end up
hurting your hands?

3732
02:50:10,370 --> 02:50:11,500
There were multiple people.

3733
02:50:12,740 --> 02:50:15,140
He hurt his hands by hitting other people.

3734
02:50:17,510 --> 02:50:18,780
Gosh.

3735
02:50:20,380 --> 02:50:22,010
Gosh, I'm getting angry.

3736
02:50:26,180 --> 02:50:27,590
Hang on.

3737
02:50:27,590 --> 02:50:28,750
Let me say one thing.

3738
02:50:30,560 --> 02:50:32,160
Today's game is...

3739
02:50:32,960 --> 02:50:35,930
the kind of game where these kinds
of things are bound to happen.

3740
02:50:36,230 --> 02:50:38,130
And you don't have to feel sorry
to me either.

3741
02:50:38,130 --> 02:50:39,260
Because...

3742
02:50:39,430 --> 02:50:41,070
when people lose control,

3743
02:50:41,630 --> 02:50:42,770
they can't hear anything.

3744
02:50:42,770 --> 02:50:45,000
Even if someone is screaming
and saying they're in pain.

3745
02:50:45,000 --> 02:50:47,570
That's something that can happen.

3746
02:50:47,570 --> 02:50:49,570
And Xitsuh, I know you got hurt badly too,

3747
02:50:49,840 --> 02:50:51,210
but I think...

3748
02:50:51,880 --> 02:50:54,450
- you should accept that and move on.
- Sure, of course.

3749
02:50:54,450 --> 02:50:56,480
This is how Bloody Game is.

3750
02:50:56,680 --> 02:50:57,850
As for what happened today,

3751
02:50:57,850 --> 02:51:00,820
those of us who got hurt
should just focus on recovering.

3752
02:51:00,920 --> 02:51:02,990
And for tomorrow's game,

3753
02:51:02,990 --> 02:51:05,620
don't carry any guilt...

3754
02:51:05,620 --> 02:51:06,990
or feel sorry about what happened.

3755
02:51:06,990 --> 02:51:09,990
Don't dwell on
how someone went too far, either.

3756
02:51:10,330 --> 02:51:12,400
That ends here.

3757
02:51:13,330 --> 02:51:14,830
- Right?
- Yes.

3758
02:51:14,830 --> 02:51:15,870
- Yes.
- Yes.

3759
02:51:15,870 --> 02:51:16,930
Understood.

3760
02:51:16,930 --> 02:51:19,400
- Everyone played fair today.
- Okay.

3761
02:51:19,900 --> 02:51:21,170
These things can happen.

3762
02:51:21,170 --> 02:51:23,010
The same thing could happen
to us tomorrow too.

3763
02:51:23,010 --> 02:51:25,710
What happened today is behind us now.

3764
02:51:25,840 --> 02:51:28,950
Tomorrow, we need to play the game
with a fresh mindset.

3765
02:51:28,950 --> 02:51:31,150
We shouldn't hold on to these things
between us.

3766
02:51:31,320 --> 02:51:34,920
Since I'm the oldest one here,

3767
02:51:35,020 --> 02:51:37,120
I felt it was my responsibility
to say that.

3768
02:51:37,120 --> 02:51:39,520
Normally, I'm not the type...

3769
02:51:39,920 --> 02:51:43,290
to hold grudges over things like this,

3770
02:51:43,530 --> 02:51:46,230
and I wasn't holding a grudge
this time either.

3771
02:51:46,230 --> 02:51:49,200
But even I got so irritated
and shaken up...

3772
02:51:49,200 --> 02:51:51,000
that I almost cursed out loud.

3773
02:51:51,470 --> 02:51:53,200
That was how angry I was.

3774
02:51:53,200 --> 02:51:54,470
But Sang Min, as the oldest member, said,

3775
02:51:54,470 --> 02:51:56,170
"These things can happen."

3776
02:51:56,170 --> 02:51:58,280
"Tomorrow, let's put it behind us
and just focus on the game."

3777
02:51:58,280 --> 02:51:59,580
And then he went upstairs.

3778
02:52:00,080 --> 02:52:01,480
I thought, "He's truly the big brother."

3779
02:52:01,750 --> 02:52:03,680
Hey, where did you get this?

3780
02:52:05,980 --> 02:52:08,490
The number of safes opened
during today's Heist Day...

3781
02:52:09,050 --> 02:52:10,150
is a total...

3782
02:52:13,790 --> 02:52:15,330
of three.

3783
02:52:27,100 --> 02:52:31,580
(Jeong Keun Woo came outside again.)

3784
02:52:34,880 --> 02:52:36,780
To be honest, I was conflicted.

3785
02:52:37,820 --> 02:52:41,050
I did contemplate whether I should...

3786
02:52:41,690 --> 02:52:44,360
open the 4th safe
and grab another 50,000 dollars...

3787
02:52:44,360 --> 02:52:47,190
about 30 seconds
or a minute before it ended.

3788
02:52:47,630 --> 02:52:49,560
But I was worried another physical
confrontation might break out.

3789
02:52:49,690 --> 02:52:50,700
- Keun Woo.
- Yes.

3790
02:52:50,700 --> 02:52:52,330
If we open this,
the fifth safe will be in there, right?

3791
02:52:52,330 --> 02:52:53,830
- Yes.
- What should we do?

3792
02:52:53,930 --> 02:52:55,100
Let's go downstairs
and see what's going on.

3793
02:52:55,330 --> 02:52:57,100
You stay here. I'll go check it out.

3794
02:52:59,300 --> 02:53:02,170
(Keun Woo heads downstairs
to check out the situation.)

3795
02:53:03,570 --> 02:53:07,110
- Come over here.
- After it's over?

3796
02:53:07,110 --> 02:53:10,210
Keun Woo has to get into a physical fight
with Seung Yong.

3797
02:53:10,210 --> 02:53:12,720
Sure. Anyway, should we open
the one upstairs or not?

3798
02:53:12,820 --> 02:53:13,820
Don't open it.

3799
02:53:19,920 --> 02:53:21,030
Let's head downstairs, Seong Beom.

3800
02:53:21,460 --> 02:53:22,460
Good job.

3801
02:53:22,860 --> 02:53:23,860
Is it over?

3802
02:53:23,860 --> 02:53:24,930
- We're not opening Number Four?
- We decided not to do it.

3803
02:53:24,930 --> 02:53:26,000
Too many people got hurt.

3804
02:53:26,000 --> 02:53:28,700
- We're not opening Number Four?
- Jin Ho suggested that we don't.

3805
02:53:28,930 --> 02:53:31,640
The older guys had stepped in
and told us to stop.

3806
02:53:32,000 --> 02:53:34,970
If I had gone ahead
and opened the fourth safe,

3807
02:53:35,240 --> 02:53:38,540
it would have downplayed what they said.

3808
02:53:39,040 --> 02:53:40,710
I was conflicted until the very end,

3809
02:53:40,710 --> 02:53:42,680
but I didn't open the fourth safe.

3810
02:53:43,780 --> 02:53:47,150
The 50,000 dollars in the unopened safe...

3811
02:53:47,650 --> 02:53:49,720
will be awarded
to the indoor alliance team.

3812
02:53:50,490 --> 02:53:53,260
Please discuss how you will divide
the acquired funds,

3813
02:53:53,590 --> 02:53:55,160
then bring the money...

3814
02:53:55,230 --> 02:53:57,560
to the Voting Room and deposit it.

3815
02:53:59,600 --> 02:54:04,170
(The outdoor alliance team
register their acquired funds.)

3816
02:54:05,000 --> 02:54:07,840
It's not easy to earn
even a single penny these days.

3817
02:54:18,550 --> 02:54:20,750
Goodness.

3818
02:54:26,320 --> 02:54:27,320
Come in.

3819
02:54:29,330 --> 02:54:30,960
First of all, the injury is fake.

3820
02:54:30,960 --> 02:54:31,960
Okay.

3821
02:54:32,660 --> 02:54:33,900
(Half an hour ago)

3822
02:54:33,900 --> 02:54:35,300
I shouldn't be here.

3823
02:54:45,840 --> 02:54:47,480
Gosh, I hope they're not here.

3824
02:54:50,350 --> 02:54:52,480
(Team C is picking up the funds
they dropped in front of the main hall.)

3825
02:55:02,530 --> 02:55:06,230
(Sang Min attempts to escape again.)

3826
02:55:17,240 --> 02:55:20,040
(Team R is blocking
the safe in the main hall.)

3827
02:55:29,550 --> 02:55:31,860
I was in pain, but it worked out.

3828
02:55:31,960 --> 02:55:34,760
I accomplished my mission by getting hurt.

3829
02:55:34,860 --> 02:55:36,960
I think I had
about 30,000 to 40,000 dollars,

3830
02:55:37,160 --> 02:55:39,830
so I think I did the best I could
in this war.

3831
02:55:40,160 --> 02:55:41,700
I'll just stick to being hurt.

3832
02:55:41,700 --> 02:55:43,030
I'll just stay here until the end.

3833
02:55:43,030 --> 02:55:44,570
That was my strategy.

3834
02:55:46,540 --> 02:55:47,910
It's going to be hard to count all this.

3835
02:55:48,810 --> 02:55:50,370
- Gosh.
- Gosh.

3836
02:55:50,370 --> 02:55:52,280
You still managed to grab a lot.

3837
02:55:52,280 --> 02:55:53,280
(Dumping everything out)

3838
02:55:56,180 --> 02:55:59,250
(The bills keep coming out endlessly.)

3839
02:56:01,520 --> 02:56:04,220
How much were you able
to stuff in your pants?

3840
02:56:04,220 --> 02:56:06,220
Gosh, I tried so hard
to prevent these from being stolen.

3841
02:56:07,790 --> 02:56:10,030
He was shaking money out of his pants.

3842
02:56:10,030 --> 02:56:12,200
It was an insane amount of money.

3843
02:56:12,500 --> 02:56:16,000
I wondered how big his pants are
for money...

3844
02:56:16,330 --> 02:56:17,370
to keep coming out like that.

3845
02:56:17,370 --> 02:56:19,570
Sang Min's fighting spirit.

3846
02:56:20,070 --> 02:56:21,540
He stuffed money in his pants,

3847
02:56:21,540 --> 02:56:24,240
in his bag, in his clothes.

3848
02:56:24,240 --> 02:56:27,380
He secured all that cash
while putting on an act.

3849
02:56:27,580 --> 02:56:31,120
I think that helped us out tremendously.

3850
02:56:31,350 --> 02:56:32,420
Gosh.

3851
02:56:33,050 --> 02:56:35,590
So this is how you win
a survival game show.

3852
02:56:35,590 --> 02:56:37,020
What a legend.

3853
02:56:37,350 --> 02:56:38,990
How would you like to divide it?

3854
02:56:38,990 --> 02:56:40,790
- We'll...
- We'll split it exactly in half.

3855
02:56:40,790 --> 02:56:42,090
In half.

3856
02:56:43,030 --> 02:56:46,000
Once we gathered everything together,
it turned out to be quite a lot.

3857
02:56:46,000 --> 02:56:47,400
Throughout the game,

3858
02:56:47,400 --> 02:56:49,530
it seemed like almost all the money
had been taken.

3859
02:56:49,830 --> 02:56:52,040
So I thought
we'd barely have 50,000 dollars.

3860
02:56:52,040 --> 02:56:54,240
But in reality, it looked like
80,000 to 90,000 dollars.

3861
02:56:54,240 --> 02:56:56,310
So I said we should split it exactly
in half.

3862
02:56:56,510 --> 02:56:58,280
It was...

3863
02:56:58,280 --> 02:57:00,010
You're strong, so it's fine.

3864
02:57:00,010 --> 02:57:03,280
(The indoor alliance team
register their acquired funds.)

3865
02:57:11,090 --> 02:57:13,060
(Ji Min was hiding with a bag of money.)

3866
02:57:14,890 --> 02:57:16,890
He saw the bag of money in the trash can,

3867
02:57:17,490 --> 02:57:19,030
but then they took it.

3868
02:57:19,030 --> 02:57:21,000
Since I experienced that already,

3869
02:57:21,230 --> 02:57:22,900
I couldn't bring myself to charge in.

3870
02:57:22,900 --> 02:57:24,670
Normally,

3871
02:57:24,840 --> 02:57:27,140
I would have pushed, grabbed,
and put up a fierce fight.

3872
02:57:27,140 --> 02:57:29,570
I can be pretty tenacious.

3873
02:57:30,570 --> 02:57:32,880
(Sung Joo got the bag of money.)

3874
02:57:35,450 --> 02:57:36,950
If the goal is simply to protect it,

3875
02:57:37,350 --> 02:57:40,990
I’ll just hide and won't run into anyone.
I thought that was my best strategy.

3876
02:57:40,990 --> 02:57:43,090
So I sat in that corner...

3877
02:57:43,090 --> 02:57:44,890
hiding with my ears open.

3878
02:57:44,890 --> 02:57:46,190
Right now, we have no money,

3879
02:57:46,190 --> 02:57:49,630
and if it only counts
when the money stays on my body,

3880
02:57:49,630 --> 02:57:53,900
every single bill is precious.
Of course, we should pick it up.

3881
02:57:53,900 --> 02:57:57,740
I think that's why I picked up
every single bill, 1 by 1.

3882
02:57:57,940 --> 02:58:00,570
How would you like to divide it?

3883
02:58:00,570 --> 02:58:02,010
Exactly in half, please.

3884
02:58:02,610 --> 02:58:04,380
(Heist Day acquired funds)

3885
02:58:04,380 --> 02:58:05,780
(Acquired funds)

3886
02:58:05,780 --> 02:58:08,280
(Total funds)

3887
02:58:08,280 --> 02:58:10,410
(Team C: 69,000 dollars,
Team R: 99,000 dollars,)

3888
02:58:10,410 --> 02:58:12,550
(Team P1: 207,000 dollars,
Team P3: 317,000 dollars)

3889
02:58:12,650 --> 02:58:13,950
Why don't you grab your...

3890
02:58:13,950 --> 02:58:15,350
Where's he?

3891
02:58:15,690 --> 02:58:18,120
- No.
- No, don't do that. It's fine.

3892
02:58:18,120 --> 02:58:19,690
That's...

3893
02:58:19,690 --> 02:58:21,860
Hey, Seung Yong. You're quite strong.

3894
02:58:25,030 --> 02:58:27,830
- I'm sorry.
- It's fine. Are your hands okay?

3895
02:58:27,830 --> 02:58:29,770
- I heard you got hurt.
- They're just scraped.

3896
02:58:29,770 --> 02:58:33,170
On the surface, everyone was saying
that it was fine...

3897
02:58:33,170 --> 02:58:35,540
and that things like that can happen,

3898
02:58:35,540 --> 02:58:38,710
but I could tell they didn't feel that way
on the inside.

3899
02:58:38,710 --> 02:58:40,440
Whether they accept my apology or not...

3900
02:58:40,440 --> 02:58:43,780
is up to them,
and I completely understand that.

3901
02:58:47,990 --> 02:58:50,220
Our team is...

3902
02:58:50,750 --> 02:58:51,960
It's really...

3903
02:58:52,690 --> 02:58:53,990
Gosh. It's uncomfortable.

3904
02:58:57,760 --> 02:58:59,800
It was a stroke of genius.

3905
02:58:59,800 --> 02:59:01,930
Deciding to team up with Team P1
for Equation Combo.

3906
02:59:02,500 --> 02:59:05,870
Gosh, if we ended up doing it
with those two...

3907
02:59:07,040 --> 02:59:09,170
- The thought gives me a headache.
- From now on...

3908
02:59:09,170 --> 02:59:10,570
One good thing came out of this.

3909
02:59:10,570 --> 02:59:12,480
As a result,

3910
02:59:12,480 --> 02:59:15,750
the teamwork between Team P1 and P3...

3911
02:59:16,510 --> 02:59:18,850
reached a new level.

3912
02:59:19,150 --> 02:59:20,720
Our teams are more united than ever,

3913
02:59:21,120 --> 02:59:25,460
and we're going to completely
crush them tomorrow.

3914
02:59:26,120 --> 02:59:28,860
He's hurt too. Look at him.

3915
02:59:28,860 --> 02:59:29,860
Right.

3916
02:59:29,860 --> 02:59:31,560
His hands are all messed up too.

3917
02:59:31,560 --> 02:59:32,630
They're just scraped.

3918
02:59:34,030 --> 02:59:35,030
So how did it happen?

3919
02:59:36,100 --> 02:59:37,530
- Did you take him down?
- No.

3920
02:59:37,530 --> 02:59:39,900
I just took it out of his arms.

3921
02:59:39,900 --> 02:59:42,710
Older people can get injured just from
having something taken away from them.

3922
02:59:43,740 --> 02:59:44,980
You can let go of the guilt...

3923
02:59:44,980 --> 02:59:46,240
- you're feeling.
- You don't have to feel guilty.

3924
02:59:46,240 --> 02:59:48,110
- It's because...
- Seriously.

3925
02:59:48,110 --> 02:59:50,410
- And Sang Min even said so himself.
- It was...

3926
02:59:50,410 --> 02:59:51,450
- He wouldn't have said that...
- It was like...

3927
02:59:51,450 --> 02:59:52,480
unless he meant it.

3928
02:59:52,850 --> 02:59:54,690
I didn't expect that from him.

3929
02:59:54,690 --> 02:59:57,820
But it's not like
he was blinded by the game.

3930
02:59:57,820 --> 02:59:59,820
He's just genuinely sincere
about everything.

3931
02:59:59,820 --> 03:00:02,190
He's kind of like a loyal...

3932
03:00:02,190 --> 03:00:03,860
knight serving his king.

3933
03:00:04,190 --> 03:00:07,130
So even if he's asked to do something
completely unreasonable,

3934
03:00:07,130 --> 03:00:09,530
he'll get it done no matter what.

3935
03:00:09,530 --> 03:00:11,870
So he blocked him
because he was told to block him.

3936
03:00:12,240 --> 03:00:13,970
And he took the money
because he was told to take it.

3937
03:00:13,970 --> 03:00:16,470
I don't think
Seung Yong did anything wrong.

3938
03:00:16,470 --> 03:00:18,310
I think that's the right way to play
the game, and I did the same.

3939
03:00:18,310 --> 03:00:21,950
I feel it's an issue where we can
just apologize and move on.

3940
03:00:21,950 --> 03:00:25,780
I don't think there's any reason
to keep dragging this out...

3941
03:00:26,150 --> 03:00:27,350
and dwelling on it.

3942
03:00:27,350 --> 03:00:29,420
- Seung Yong, are you crying again?
- Are you crying again?

3943
03:00:29,420 --> 03:00:31,560
- Gosh.
- Goodness.

3944
03:00:31,560 --> 03:00:33,690
- What good is it going to do...
- Why are you crying?

3945
03:00:33,690 --> 03:00:35,060
if you keep crying?

3946
03:00:35,460 --> 03:00:37,830
It's strange.
We just went through Heist Day.

3947
03:00:38,400 --> 03:00:41,500
Team C, Team R, and Team P1.

3948
03:00:41,870 --> 03:00:43,500
We were hugging each other...

3949
03:00:43,670 --> 03:00:46,540
and celebrating our hard work.

3950
03:00:46,640 --> 03:00:48,410
And just a few hours later,

3951
03:00:48,940 --> 03:00:50,470
we suddenly became enemies.

3952
03:00:51,480 --> 03:00:53,710
It was such a strange feeling.

3953
03:00:54,010 --> 03:00:55,780
Well, as it happens,

3954
03:00:56,410 --> 03:00:59,950
starting tomorrow,
Shin Seung Yong is the target.

3955
03:01:00,020 --> 03:01:01,020
We'll just...

3956
03:01:01,890 --> 03:01:03,150
We'll just have to eliminate him.

3957
03:01:05,260 --> 03:01:06,360
We'll have to kill him off.
